* @title Recursive unevaluated pattern matches Y followed by Zs
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 2, Section 2.16.3
* @expect >>>
* Y
* YZZZ
* YZ
* YZZ
* YZZZZ
* <<<
          P = *P 'Z' | 'Y'
          PO = P . OUTPUT
          'Y' PO
          'YZZZ' PO
          'XYZ' PO
          'YZZX' PO
          'AYZZZZB' PO
END
